//	                 target_id required.
//	GROUP          — visible to members of `target_id` chat.Group.
//	                 target_id required.
//	SELF           — author-only (private note). all others unused.
//	CUSTOM_ALLOW   — visible only to `actor_ptids`. allow_list, length>=1.
//	                 base_kind: unused (the list IS the rule).
